Additional Best Practices

Enable responsive containers so the app works well on desktop and tablet.

Store the Power Apps URL in an app variable (for example, Set(varAppLink, "...")) so it only needs to be updated in one place if the app URL changes.

Use the email address from the SharePoint Person column (User.Email) instead of maintaining a separate email field, ensuring emails are always sent to the correct user.

Refresh the SharePoint list after sending emails so the Last Email Sent and Email Status fields are immediately reflected in the gallery.

In the Send All Emails flow, configure Run after on the update actions to mark each record as Sent or Failed based on the email action result, allowing processing to continue even if one recipient fails.



